D, maternity benefits and more with over 4000 cashless hospital networks. Watch this video, to know how to apply for health insurance cover within 5 minutes.\n\nGet a Health Insurance in just 3 steps with ICICI Internet Banking:\n- Login to Internet Banking and select “General Insurance”.\n- Select “Group Health Insurance” and click on “Insure Now”.\n- Select your desired sum assured amount.\n- Add OPD & Maternity Benefits.\n- Fill in your personal details and pre-existing diseases, if any.\n- Click on “+” to add additional family members you would like to insure.\n- Fill in the nomination details and “Proceed” to payment.\n- Enter your OTP and the payment is done!\n- Policy Purchased!\n\nTo know more about ICICI Bank Health Insurance Cover:\nhttps://www.icicibank.com/Personal-Banking/insurance/health-insurance/index.page\n\nSubscribe to the ICICI Bank YouTube Channel and remember to press the bell icon to get notifications on our latest products and services offerings. \nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/icicibank/videos?sub_confirmation=1\n\nThere is more than one way to connect with us, so be sure to check our ICICI Bank at:\nWebsite: https://www.icicibank.com\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/icicibank\nLinkedIn: https://in.linkedin.com/company/icici-bank\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/icicibank\"", "channel_id": "UCDsxd7FVqC4n9AiggDXHUqQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDsxd7FVqC4n9AiggDXHUqQ", "duration": 60, "view_count": 3826, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TKdZen8_0fs", "categories": ["Film & Animation"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "chapters": [{"start_time": 0, "end_time": 7.0, "title": "<Untitled Chapter 1>"}, {"start_time": 7.0, "title": "Login to Internet Banking and select \"General In